            "review_title": "Review at Silk Garden Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nam Cao\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nAmazing\nApr 2019 • Couples\nServiecs good, meals perfect! I like meals! I will come back! ❤️❤️ food excelent and my waitress - Thủy very good, friendly and lovely.\nWritten April 13, 2019\nWyndham Garden Hanoi\nDear NamC160,\n\nThank you so much for your review of Silk Garden. Great to hear that you have had good experience and enjoyed your meal at our restaurant .Your feedback is a motivation for us to deliver better service.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back very soon!\n\nSincerely,\nQuynh Anh, Marketing Executive\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
