            "review_title": "Review at Silk Garden Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Bellecondo\n5 contributions\n0\nWould love to recommended!\nApr 2019 • Friends\nThe first time come to restaurant in the new hotel. My friend stayed there and we have breakfast in silk garden. Beautiful palace, buffet station so lovely with many choice. Especially, staffs were friendly .My friend is gluten fee. So M. Ann - manager who best take care and show him all the food that he can eat . And her team ( amber, vivian and sophie) were helpful also. Hope they will keep good working like that. Thank you Ann & team.\nRead more\nWritten April 11, 2019\nWyndham Garden Hanoi\nDear BelleconD,\n\nThank you so much for your review of Silk Garden. Great to hear that you have had good experience and enjoyed your meal at our restaurant. Your feedback is a great motivation for us to deliver better service to customers.\n\nLook forward to welcoming you back very soon!\n\nSincerely,\nQuynh Anh, Marketing Executive\nRead more\nWritten April 12, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
