            "review_title": "Review at Silk Garden Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MYG29289\nSeoul, South Korea3 contributions\n1\nBetter place to spoil your tounge\nApr 2019 • Friends\nI visited it when i try to see my friend.Even paying the normal price, this restaurant is good choice value for money. The food selection is vast, and very good and tasty too. Make sure you go early to avoid queues and get the food served freshly. Also,make sure you go on an empty stomach. \nTaste is good but service is great. I was served by Ann ,her local name is Chang or Jang i dont know. She was super caring and helpful. Everytime my cup was nearly out, she appeared and top it up so that i a think that it was always full. Great service!\nRead more\nWritten April 11, 2019\nWyndham Garden Hanoi\nDear MYG29289,\n\nWe are so happy to hear that you have had good experience and enjoyed your meal at Silk Garden. Thank you for your feedback. This is a great motivation for our staffs to deliver better service to customers.\n\nAgain, thank you for choosing us and look forward to welcoming you back very soon!\n\nSincerely,\nQuynh Anh, Marketing Executive\nRead more\nWritten April 12, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
