            "review_title": "Review at Silk Garden Restaurant",
            "review_text": "박지수\nSeoul, South Korea5 contributions\n2\nPerfect taste for cheap price\nApr 2019 • Solo\nAbout space: Location is not really great but d quietness\n- Price: cheap for a 5 star hotel's restaurant. \nFood: I picked my main course was a dish of duck with coffee sauce.\n- Fever: for my taste is freshly mix. Love it ! \n-Service: 6- star service.I was served by Amber, she was so cute and helpful. Her attitude was professional and I could have her all the time i need without raising hand or giving any sign.Just look!. I appreciate that attitude and service-mind.\nThe only thing made me regret is that I couldn't see my friend-Jin- who recommended it. She told me that she was working here but it turned out she was home because of health trouble.\nHope to see you here next time Jin and thank you for Amber again!\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2019\nWyndham Garden Hanoi\nDear parkjis00, \n\nThank you so much for your review of Silk Garden. Great to hear that you have had good experience and enjoyed your meal at our restaurant. Your feedback is a great motivation for our staffs to deliver better services to all of our customers.\n\nAgain, thank you for choosing us and look forward to welcoming you back very soon! \n\nSincerely, \nQuynh Anh, Marketing Executive\nRead more\nWritten April 10, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
